{
    "title": "SUPERSTAR ATEEZ",
    "description": "8 makes 1 team! The global K-POP rhythm game SUPERSTAR Series meets ATEEZ!\r\nEnjoy the songs of the global sensation ATEEZ in SUPERSTAR ATEEZ!\r\n\r\n#ATEEZ's song as a rhythm game!\r\n\u00b7 From debut songs to latest songs! Wait for a new song every week!\r\n\u00b7 Enjoy your own customized difficulty from EASY mode to HARD mode!\r\n\r\n# Collect a personality card!\r\n\u00b7 Collect ATEEZ's cards and upgrade to more beautiful and powerful cards!\r\n\u00b7 Collect the only one card in the world, not only in general theme cards but also a limited -themed card that goes with songs!\r\n\r\n# Competition with ATEEZ fans around the world!\r\n\u00b7 Achieve high rankings in the weekly weekly league and receive rewards!\r\nWhere is my limit? Challenge the My Records every month!\r\n\u00b7 Verify my skills with world records that take place every season!\r\n\r\nExclusive content that can only be met at SUPERSTAR ATEEZ(SSATZ)!\r\nMeet the moving photo card in the game!\r\n\u00b7 From start to finish! Play the game with ATEEZ voice!\r\n\r\n# Exciting and various missions and events!\r\nClear every week's mission!\r\n\u00b7 You can get a special reward on the artist comeback and anniversary!\r\n\u00b7 Do not miss the opportunity to win prizes such as limited theme cards and signs CDs.\r\n\r\nOfficial Twitter: https://twitter.com/superstarateeez\r\nOfficial Instagram: https://www.instagram.com/superstarateez_official/\r\nOfficial Facebook: https://www.facebook.com/superstarateeez\r\n\r\n---------------------\r\n\r\n[Guide to access rights to smartphone apps]\r\nWhen using the app, we are requesting access to the following services.\r\n \r\n[Required approach permission]\r\n-Photo/Video/File: To save game data in storage\r\n-Reading external repository, recording: Necessary to store various settings in the game and to store music data cache\r\n-Call: Necessary to analyze advertising tracking and create PUSH reception tokens\r\n-Wi-Fi connection information: When downloading additional data, it is necessary to check the Wi-Fi connection and send a guide message.\r\n-ID: Necessary for 'Creating and Confirmation of User Revision'\r\n\r\n[Selection approach permission]\r\n-Note: To receive information notifications and advertising PUSH notifications sent from the game app.\r\n* You can use the app without agreeing with the optional access rights.\r\n* It may be difficult to use some of the functions of the service when the optional approach.\r\n\r\n[How to withdraw access to access]\r\nSettings> Select the app and withdraw\r\n\r\n\u203b If the notes do not come down smoothly when playing the game, please check the \"Low \" in the [Display Settings] option of [Settings]!\r\n\u203b SUPERSTAR ATEEZ(SSATZ) can be enjoyed for free, but the fee is charged when purchasing some paid items.\r\n\u203b If you have any inquiries, please send it to support.superstar.ateez@dalcomsoft.com and we will do our best to consult.\r\n---------------------\r\nSUPERSTAR ATEEZ(SSATZ) related sweet and soft game inquiry\r\nE-mail: support.superstar.ateez@dalcomsoft.com",
    "descriptionHTML": "8 makes 1 team! The global K-POP rhythm game SUPERSTAR Series meets ATEEZ!<br>Enjoy the songs of the global sensation ATEEZ in SUPERSTAR ATEEZ!<br><br>#ATEEZ&#39;s song as a rhythm game!<br>\u00b7 From debut songs to latest songs! Wait for a new song every week!<br>\u00b7 Enjoy your own customized difficulty from EASY mode to HARD mode!<br><br># Collect a personality card!<br>\u00b7 Collect ATEEZ&#39;s cards and upgrade to more beautiful and powerful cards!<br>\u00b7 Collect the only one card in the world, not only in general theme cards but also a limited -themed card that goes with songs!<br><br># Competition with ATEEZ fans around the world!<br>\u00b7 Achieve high rankings in the weekly weekly league and receive rewards!<br>Where is my limit? Challenge the My Records every month!<br>\u00b7 Verify my skills with world records that take place every season!<br><br>Exclusive content that can only be met at SUPERSTAR ATEEZ(SSATZ)!<br>Meet the moving photo card in the game!<br>\u00b7 From start to finish! Play the game with ATEEZ voice!<br><br># Exciting and various missions and events!<br>Clear every week&#39;s mission!<br>\u00b7 You can get a special reward on the artist comeback and anniversary!<br>\u00b7 Do not miss the opportunity to win prizes such as limited theme cards and signs CDs.<br><br>Official Twitter: https://twitter.com/superstarateeez<br>Official Instagram: https://www.instagram.com/superstarateez_official/<br>Official Facebook: https://www.facebook.com/superstarateeez<br><br>---------------------<br><br>[Guide to access rights to smartphone apps]<br>When using the app, we are requesting access to the following services.<br> <br>[Required approach permission]<br>-Photo/Video/File: To save game data in storage<br>-Reading external repository, recording: Necessary to store various settings in the game and to store music data cache<br>-Call: Necessary to analyze advertising tracking and create PUSH reception tokens<br>-Wi-Fi connection information: When downloading additional data, it is necessary to check the Wi-Fi connection and send a guide message.<br>-ID: Necessary for &#39;Creating and Confirmation of User Revision&#39;<br><br>[Selection approach permission]<br>-Note: To receive information notifications and advertising PUSH notifications sent from the game app.<br>* You can use the app without agreeing with the optional access rights.<br>* It may be difficult to use some of the functions of the service when the optional approach.<br><br>[How to withdraw access to access]<br>Settings&gt; Select the app and withdraw<br><br>\u203b If the notes do not come down smoothly when playing the game, please check the &quot;Low &quot; in the [Display Settings] option of [Settings]!<br>\u203b SUPERSTAR ATEEZ(SSATZ) can be enjoyed for free, but the fee is charged when purchasing some paid items.<br>\u203b If you have any inquiries, please send it to support.superstar.ateez@dalcomsoft.com and we will do our best to consult.<br>---------------------<br>SUPERSTAR ATEEZ(SSATZ) related sweet and soft game inquiry<br>E-mail: support.superstar.ateez@dalcomsoft.com",
